Subject: [0001-gcc15-compat] ICU 58.x on modern toolchains: xlocale.h was removed in glibc 2.26+ (merged into locale.h), and -Wimplicit-fallthrough is an error on GCC 15+.

ICU 58.x on modern toolchains: xlocale.h was removed in glibc 2.26+
(merged into locale.h), and -Wimplicit-fallthrough is an error on GCC
15+.

---
diff --git a/a/icu/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp b/b/icu/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp
index ab5b557..9bfacaf 100644
--- a/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp
+++ b/source/i18n/digitlst.cpp
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@
 # if U_PLATFORM_USES_ONLY_WIN32_API || U_PLATFORM == U_PF_CYGWIN
 #   include <locale.h>
 # else
-#   include <xlocale.h>
+#   include <locale.h>
 # endif
 #endif
 
